+# Plan
+
+1. Update category deletion to resolve the category in the merchant store, collect the root and all descendants, remove only those category associations from every affected product, and persist the products before deleting the category subtree.
+2. Ensure deletion of an unknown id consistently raises the existing resource-not-found response and does not partially mutate data.
+3. Add regression tests for retained products/category associations, descendant deletion, empty deleted-category product listings, and 404 behavior; include cart/order safety coverage if the existing fixtures support it without broad test setup changes.
+4. Run the focused Maven tests, then build/test the affected modules and report any environment limitations.
